{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cb80ecc0b2cf839f","name":"Astraal Vao","source":{"id":"source:reference-cb80ecc0b2cf839f","title":"Astraal Vao","revision":15985,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:29Z","sha256":"0bbce06904348e63f935bb33cd34b98a3a9a3eaab02c30d029b280ebac29fb62","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15985","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Astraal%20Vao&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cb80ecc0b2cf839f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Mission"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Mission","referenceId":"reference:16d92c7565f38456"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The sister of noted Jedi ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shado Vao"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shado_Vao","referenceId":"reference:745610874609f6cb"}," and a faithful member of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Mission"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Mission","referenceId":"reference:16d92c7565f38456"},", Astraal Vao is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," missionary and also a trusted friend of Imperial Knight ",{"tag":"a","children":["Marasiah Fel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Marasiah_Fel","referenceId":"reference:0b6846f8e68c971f"},". Astraal Vao has spent many years trying to protect her friend from the Imperial agents who have hunted her since her father was deposed. Astraal Vao must constantly perform a balancing act when it comes to her friend Marasiah; Astraal continues to serves ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Mission"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Mission","referenceId":"reference:16d92c7565f38456"}," loyally but also hides her friend from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", for fear that Marasiah might be harmed.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Intelligent and gentle, Astraal Vao epitomizes the kind of person ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Mission"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Mission","referenceId":"reference:16d92c7565f38456"}," is trying to attract. Astraal is dedicated to the ideals of the Mission, and thanks to her years of devoted service, she has become a trusted confidant of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Konrad Rus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Konrad_Rus","referenceId":"reference:ff09b328b262be0e"},". However, Astraal does not realize that her mentor confides in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"},", and she remains unaware of the fact that her defiance of the Empire does not go unnoticed. Astraal Vao is also Force-sensitive, though she has no formal training.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Astraal Vao Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Visio